    <paragraph>For the following exercises, graph and interpret applications of slope-intercept. The equation $$P = 31 + 1.75w$$ models the relation between the amount of Tuyet’s monthly water bill payment, $$P$$ , in dollars, and the number of units of water, $$w$$ , used.</paragraph>
    <exercise number="45" has_solution="false">
